  "claim": "This animal, which is white in winter and brown in summer, lives throughout a region and can trace its roots to an extinct animal that lived in the Himalayas. Its Ediacaran name is Fjällräven. Circumpolar peoples people originate from this region.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Vulpes qiuzhudingi. Sentence: Vulpes qiuzhudingi is an extinct species of fox found in the Himalayas.\nPage: Vulpes qiuzhudingi. Sentence: The species is believed to be the ancestor of \"Vulpes lagopus\", the modern Arctic fox, which would support the \"Out of Tibet\" theory: namely, that a number of current arctic species trace their ancestry to species originally from the Tibetan Plateau.\nPage: Arctic fox. Sentence: The Arctic fox (\"Vulpes lagopus\"), also known as the white fox, polar fox, or snow fox, is a small fox native to the Arctic regions of the Northern Hemisphere and common throughout the Arctic tundra biome.\nPage: Arctic fox. Sentence: It has a deep thick fur which is brown in summer and white in winter.\nPage: Fjällräven. Sentence: Fjällräven (] , Swedish for Arctic fox) is a Swedish company specialising in outdoor equipment—mostly clothing and rucksacks. Fjällräven was founded in 1960 by Åke Nordin (1936–2013).\nPage: Circumpolar peoples. Sentence: Circumpolar peoples and Arctic peoples are umbrella terms for the various indigenous peoples of the Arctic.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Vulpes qiuzhudingi. Sentence: Vulpes qiuzhudingi is an extinct species of fox found in the Himalayas.\nPage: Vulpes qiuzhudingi. Sentence: The species is believed to be the ancestor of \"Vulpes lagopus\", the modern Arctic fox, which would support the \"Out of Tibet\" theory: namely, that a number of current arctic species trace their ancestry to species originally from the Tibetan Plateau.\nPage: Arctic fox. Sentence: The Arctic fox (\"Vulpes lagopus\"), also known as the white fox, polar fox, or snow fox, is a small fox native to the Arctic regions of the Northern Hemisphere and common throughout the Arctic tundra biome.\nPage: Arctic fox. Sentence: It has a deep thick fur which is brown in summer and white in winter.\nPage: Fjällräven. Sentence: Fjällräven (] , Swedish for Arctic fox) is a Swedish company specialising in outdoor equipment—mostly clothing and rucksacks. Fjällräven was founded in 1960 by Åke Nordin (1936–2013).\nPage: Circumpolar peoples. Sentence: Circumpolar peoples and Arctic peoples are umbrella terms for the various indigenous peoples of the Arctic.",
